<title>USA: J. Ray McDermott CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>J. Ray McDermott CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Marine construction company J. Ray McDermott S.A. said on Wednesday Richard Foreman, chief financial officer and executive vice president, tendered his resignation to pursue other interests.</p>
<p>Daniel Gaubert, vice president of finance, would assume all duties and responsibilities previously held by Foreman, the company said.</p>
<p>Foreman has agreed to remain available until March 31, to assist management with the transition and to complete certain projects, the company said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
